    "page_content": "1. Audit Objective\nTo assess compliance with the Order Intake Approval Authority Matrix and Order Backlog monitoring requirements\nunder POL-ORD-003 v1.0, and evaluate control CTRL-REV-016.\n2. Background and Scope\nThis audit plan covers orders booked between January 2025 and May 2025 for approval matrix testing, and quarterly\nBacklog review reports for Q4 2024 and Q1 2025 for aging testing.\n3. Key Risk Indicators (KRIs)",
